  "body": "[Codex] On behalf of @sfmskywalker.\n\n## Problem and result\n\nBPMN needs a recoverable execution identity while preserving native composition, authored material and saved executions. This hosts direct and embedded BPMN on the existing mailbox, ownership and atomic checkpoint authority with released BPMN0.5.0, supported human/incident commands, delivery-time broadcast cohorts, timers, bounded retry and RunBpmn/RunEtl bindings. Native composite fault policy remains unchanged.\n\nThe latest fixes prevent a terminal model from acknowledging embedding cancellation while native cancellation remains owed, and report constructor-invalid owned queued commands with contextual domain errors. Current-main integration retains actual migration lineage and restores the older public constructor alongside the new optional-lock signature.\n\n## Related issue and acceptance\n\nFixes #2898; program #2892/spec1017; retained owner-transferred Codex claim6461197535. The [qualification index](https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/blob/82f6202a5/specs/1017-direct-bpmn-hosting/evidence/qualification.md) maps supported lifecycle/journey evidence and limits. #2907/#2908 and overall production acceptance remain open.\n\n## Current repair qualification\n\nCandidate5ff0d52c6 pushed, main e26c adopted. Original queued-result and6 current cold-host cases pass; BPMN507/EF1811, prior full hosting45/Runtime3083,API15,Architecture594, browser59/frontend2812 pass at recorded sources.156 assets/frozen104 verify. Round10 begins;9/16 complete,none clean. Draft; exact CI/protected/post-main and broader acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6547225864\n\n## Validation\n\nCandidate5ff0d52c6 pushed, main e26c adopted. Original queued-result and6 current cold-host cases pass; BPMN507/EF1811, prior full hosting45/Runtime3083,API15,Architecture594, browser59/frontend2812 pass at recorded sources.156 assets/frozen104 verify. Round10 begins;9/16 complete,none clean. Draft; exact CI/protected/post-main and broader acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6547225864 Earlier source-bound results/failures remain in the portable qualification index.\n\n## Remaining gates\n\nCandidate5ff0d52c6 pushed, main e26c adopted. Original queued-result and6 current cold-host cases pass; BPMN507/EF1811, prior full hosting45/Runtime3083,API15,Architecture594, browser59/frontend2812 pass at recorded sources.156 assets/frozen104 verify. Round10 begins;9/16 complete,none clean. Draft; exact CI/protected/post-main and broader acceptance open. https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-foundation/pull/3410#issuecomment-6547225864 T041/T043 are evidenced; T044 prepares Implemented at merge. T042 and earlier owner decisions stay settled. T045-T047 clean exact-head review, required CI, protected merge and resulting-main remain open. No merge before verified current Studio recovery, clean exact-head full review and green required checks without unresolved holds.\n",
